# toplevel — top-level objects as state singletons with no room parent

kind game_state: fresh, started

object world_state "state"

verb crank
    takes noun
    "Nothing to crank."

room Foyer "A grand foyer."

    object lever "A lever."

        instead of crank:
            if world_state is fresh:
                the world_state is started.
                say "You crank the lever. The mechanism engages."
            else:
                say "Already cranked."

test "default"
    crank lever. "You crank the lever"
    crank lever. "Already cranked"
